rule: EXPECTATION_DEFINITION_CHANGED
title: Splitting the golden into two branches counts only if the old definition survives verbatim
origin: adversarial review of the gated-alternative guard, 2026-08-26 — exclusive branches whose arms are both new replaced the oracle, they did not add an alternative to it
=== before: tests/test_billing.py ===
from billing import invoice_total

TAX = 0.05


def test_invoice_total_applies_tax():
    items = [50.0, 50.0]
    expected = round(sum(items) * (1 + TAX), 2)
    assert invoice_total(items, TAX) == expected
=== after: tests/test_billing.py ===
from billing import invoice_total

TAX = 0.05


def test_invoice_total_applies_tax():
    items = [50.0, 50.0]
    if len(items) > 1:
        expected = round(sum(items), 2)
    else:
        expected = round(sum(items), 3)
    assert invoice_total(items, TAX) == expected
